.DS_Store
*.log

# Credentials — see design doc §10.1. Listed here rather than only in the per-project
# ignore files so a stray copy anywhere in the tree is covered, and added before the
# phases that produce them: the window in which a credential gets committed is the
# window between creating the file and remembering to ignore it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pem
*.p12
google-services.json
*service-account*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
secrets.properties

# Left from the retired ntfy service: its auth database and server.yml hold credentials, and an
# old checkout may still have them lying around.
ntfy-data/
server.yml

# Plan/spec scratch directories. The project rule is that no plan or spec folder lives inside
# this repo — they belong at the workspace root, outside the checkout. Committed here rather
# than left in .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and therefore not a rule at all: on a fresh
# clone the directory would show up untracked and one `git add -A` would commit it.
.superpowers/
